# DrumMania 6th Mix and GuitarFreaks 7th Mix in session (with gtrfrk7m-session, run alongside: two
# processes on one session cable, runtime/sys573/link.h). This side hosts the multi-session unit.
# From what drmn6m-install left: NOTE 605 (Test at 1500), then attract; two coins and Start at the
# title open the session joining period, the GuitarFreaks cabinet joins, and both pass the caution
# screen, the mode and the music select (Start every 300 frames) and play the first stage together,
# its music from the unit: on the pads, every 12 frames a hi-hat, snare, high tom, low tom, cymbal,
# or hi-hat or snare with the bass pedal. MAME can't run a session: this checks that two runs agree.
game drmn6m

at 1500 press "Service Mode" 8   # NOTE 605
at 10800 press "Coin 1" 8
at 10840 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 11400 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 11700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12300 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 12900 press "1 Player Start" 8

# the first stage
